      "text": "a. There is hereby established a Mayor's Advisory Council on the Development of Recycling Markets and Businesses. The Advisory Council shall include representatives of the business community, environmental groups, and other organizations having recycling expertise. The members shall be appointed for a term of two years and shall serve without compensation. The City Council shall also be requested to participate on the Advisory Council.",
